OL,3,GNEWSAParents demand safety measures
OL,4,Anear school crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents who have been "forced" to
OL,7,Fpatrol a school crossing in
OL,8,FPeterborough have launched a petition
OL,9,Fcalling for improved road safety
OL,10,Fmeasures in the area.
OL,12,FElliott and Joanne have been helping
OL,13,Fpupils cross safely near Dogsthorpe
OL,14,FAcademy on Central Avenue since last
OL,15,FMonday, amid fears children could be
OL,16,Fhit by speeding drivers.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
