OL,3,GNEWSAParents demand safety measures
OL,4,Anear school crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe online petition, launched on
OL,7,FThursday, calls on Peterborough City
OL,8,FCouncil to install better signage for
OL,9,Fmotorists and a signal-controlled
OL,10,Fcrossing outside the school to help
OL,11,Fprevent future incidents.
OL,13,F"Every day we're nearly hit," Joanne
OL,14,Fsaid. "Cars are just not slowing down
OL,15,Fand I cannot walk away from this until
OL,16,Fit settles down."
